: 50030, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_013oaTN2K7xRYdvmkLv2S3ur", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2025", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 50030, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_013oaTN2K7xRYdvmkLv2S3ur", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 52048, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MGsi1RrnXSfo5bJiKZQ5x1", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 52348, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MGsi1RrnXSfo5bJiKZQ5x1", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52348, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MGsi1RrnXSfo5bJiKZQ5x1", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 54560, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again (error rate 0.002). The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. Since v2.3.0 had been healthy in production, no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions split across v2.3.0 and v2.3.1. I checked the state and retried the same rollback once, and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to open the incident timed out. A check showed INC-0001 had already been created, so I did not create a duplicate. Its summary covers the failure, the partial rollout, the retry, and the post-rollback health.\n\nFollow-ups for the on-call team: find out why v2.3.1 failed and why the orchestrator halted the first rollout. v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed and verified healthy.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_0148HspFBChWuWgj62UMkQzB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01E8d6MDdh3tpL7ssxTTz9ZU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The latest production release that was healthy is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_019x4pAKayhPVEaVdqutaxNp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure after us-east. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Mped8ip8rNPwFSYBwrGgVj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_013n5TLQUENesRGSiruecUzJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollout is partway done: us-east is on v2.3.0, while us-west and eu-west are still on the unhealthy v2.3.1. The target version is still v2.3.0, so I'll retry the same rollback once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015r4aPFH4PbNGVRnDMpCzHM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_016jrK9q7uHqQTsN8xq22JAX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback is complete and checkout-api is healthy on v2.3.0 in all three regions. Next I'll open the SEV2 incident and record what happened, including the partial failure.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_013oaTN2K7xRYdvmkLv2S3ur", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy in production. Action taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent production release that was healthy (v2.2.9 and v2.3.0 are the healthy production releases; v2.3.1-rc was only in staging and is unhealthy). The first rollback attempt halted with a partial_failure orchestrator error after us-east (us-east was on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1). I checked state and retried the same rollback to v2.3.0, which completed in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west on v2.3.0). Post-rollback status: healthy, error rate 0.002. Follow-ups: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed and 